flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read trimmed registration inputs]
    B --> C{validateRegistrationInput returns true?}
    C -- No --> D[Stop]
    C -- Yes --> E[Prepare user insert SQL]
    E --> F[Open DB connection]
    F --> G[Bind form values]
    G --> H[Execute insert]
    H --> I[Open LoginFrame]
    F --> J[On SQL error show error and print stack trace]
    J --> D
    I --> K[End]
    D --> K
